  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 4904.01 Application for Original Certificate",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 4904.01 Application for Original Certificate.\n\n(a) An applicant for an original certificate shall submit the following to the state fire marshal’s office:\n\n(1) A completed form DSFM 87;\n\n(2) The applicable fee;\n\n(3) Evidence of 4,000 hours of field experience; and\n\n(4) A copy of a certificate evidencing successful completion of the educational and certification requirements, pursuant to Saf-C 4903.\n\n(b) An incomplete application shall be returned to the applicant with an explanation as to why the application is being returned.\n\nSource. #8650, eff 6-2-06; ss by #9766-A, eff 8-3-10",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c4900.html"
